victory12 = "Dead or alive, if your moves are so obvious, they'll never work on me."
victory13 = "There is no future for me, just as there is no longer one for you."
victory14 = "Cold and dark... That's death. You should learn to savor it."
victory15 = "That's a shame. Your desire to live is what shackles you."
victory16 = "Die."

